{"id":"n67175-1-2","stage":1,"title":"억 · 亿","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67175-1-2-1","ko":"이 아파트 비싸 보이는데 값이 얼마쯤 될까?","zh":"这栋公寓看起来好贵啊，大概要多少钱呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파트","meaning":"公寓","explanation":"아파트：公寓","readings":[{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29610","senseId":"1","lemma":"아파트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싸","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이는데","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"값이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"값：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마쯤","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까?","meaning":"为","explanation":"되다：为；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","en